.Dd March 2, 2026
.Dt ELF_LINK_ADD_DYNAMIC_ENTRY 3
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm elf_link_add_dynamic_entry
.Nd append one .dynamic tag/value record to an object
.Sh LIBRARY
libelfobj
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In elfobj.h
.Ft elf_err_t
.Fn elf_link_add_dynamic_entry "elfobj_t *obj" "int64_t tag" "uint64_t value"
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Fn elf_link_add_dynamic_entry
ensures
.Pa .dynamic
exists and appends one entry with
.Fa tag
and
.Fa value .
Entry size follows ELF class (8 bytes total on ELF32, 16 on ELF64).
.Sh RETURN VALUES
Returns
.Dv ELF_OK
on success, otherwise an
.Vt elf_err_t
code.
.Sh ERRORS
Typical failures include
.Dv ELF_ERR_STATE
for invalid arguments and allocation/append failures.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr elf_link_add_got_section 3 ,
.Xr elf_link_add_plt_section 3
